{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, approach, take and check object properties, do specific task, move to destination, or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
